sequenceDiagram
  participant P as Parent Pi Session
  participant G as piv-safe-verify
  participant R as Subagent Runner
  participant C as Child Session
  participant O as Observatory
  participant S as Session Log

  P->>G: delegate(role, task, scope, context, resources)
  G->>G: Validate schema, trust, mode, active tools
  G->>R: Launch narrowed profile + cancellation signal
  R->>O: subagent_created / subagent_started
  R->>C: Fresh prompt, scoped tools, inherited model
  loop Bounded execution
    C->>R: Tool call / progress
    R->>O: Tool activity snapshot
  end
  C-->>R: Assistant result or failure
  R->>R: Redact, cap, normalize evidence, verify result
  R->>O: Terminal snapshot
  R-->>P: result + verification + launch provenance
  R->>S: Durable entry only for async jobs
